cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ProteinToolkit"
abstract: >-
  Integrated protein analysis pipeline: sequence statistics, motif and
  catalytic-residue detection, EC-class prediction, structural pocket
  analysis, and AutoDock Vina docking with ligand screening, fused into one
  confidence-scored report.
type: software
